  "title": "My Oh-Yeah Sauce",
  "description": "A sweet, dark brown barbecue sauce for pork, beef, or just about anything on the grill goes together quickly, and has a complex, sweet and tangy flavor with overtones of molasses, brown mustard, honey, and Asian sauces. This recipe makes a big batch.",
